sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant App
    participant Redis
    participant DB as Database

    Client->>App: Request data
    App->>Redis: Check cache (GET key)
    alt Data in cache
        Redis->>App: Return cached data
    else Cache miss
        App->>DB: Query database
        DB->>App: Return data
        App->>Redis: Cache data (SET key value)
    end
    App->>Client: Respond with data